conch.app carries whisper.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp) as
Contents/Helpers/whisper-cli and Contents/Helpers/whisper-server, built from the
revision seashell pins (927cfce34f31707e17f2bff35c349632fb9e2c3a), statically
linked, with Metal on Apple silicon.

whisper.cpp is Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors and is distributed
under the MIT license (LICENSE, beside this notice, unmodified from the pinned
source tree). The source tarball's sha256 and the exact build flags are in
scripts/fetch-engine.sh; scripts/embed-engine.sh copies the binaries into the
app and signs them with the app's identity.
